8. Total written: $2 + 2 + 2 + username\_len + 16 + 20 + in\_buffer\_size = 42 + username\_len + in\_buffer\_size$.
9. The allocated size is $106 + in\_buffer\_size$. 
10. Since $42 + username\_len$ can be up to 106, the total written ($42 + username\_len + in\_buffer\_size$) is always $\le 106 + in\_buffer\_size$. 
